      },
      "dc:source": "c2022a00048.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) A person must not be appointed as the Age Discrimination\nCommissioner under section 53A for a period if the sum of the\nfollowing exceeds 7 years:\n\n(a) that period;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Legislation Amendment\n(Selection and Appointment) Act 2022\nNo. 48, 2022\n\n(b) any periods of previous appointment of the person as the Age\nDiscrimination Commissioner under that section.\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Act 1986",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) A person must not be appointed as the Age Discrimination\nCommissioner under section 53A for a period if the sum of the\nfollowing exceeds 7 years:\n\n(a) that period;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Legislation Amendment\n(Selection and Appointment) Act 2022\nNo. 48, 2022\n\n(b) any periods of previous appointment of the person as the Age\nDiscrimination Commissioner under that section.\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Act 1986",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7e206113c4fe2e5d2ffc43f61898ba80f87d675ceadebb383b569476040c6c8f",
      "skos:note": "No appointment exceeding 7 years is allowed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022a00048#sch-1-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 After subsection 53B(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) A person must not be appointed as the Age Discrimination\nCommissioner under section 53A for a period if the sum of the\nfollowing exceeds 7 years:\n\n(a) that period;\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Legislation Amendment\n(Selection and Appointment) Act 2022\nNo. 48, 2022\n\n(b) any periods of previous appointment of the person as the Age\nDiscrimination Commissioner under that section.\nAustralian Human Rights Commission Act 1986"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-4-norm",
