      "dc:source": "c2022a00048.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(1B) Paragraph (1A)(b) does not apply in relation to the reappointment\nof a person who, immediately before the start of the period of\nreappointment, holds office as the President under a previous\nappointment under subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(1B) Paragraph (1A)(b) does not apply in relation to the reappointment\nof a person who, immediately before the start of the period of\nreappointment, holds office as the President under a previous\nappointment under subsection (1).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-5-ss-1b-norm"
        },
