    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Subsection 46MC(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022a00048#sch-1-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2022a00048.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2022a00048.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) A person must not be appointed under subsection (1) as the\nNational Children’s Commissioner unless the Minister is satisfied\nthat:\n\n(a) the person has appropriate qualifications, knowledge or\nexperience; and\n\n(b) the selection of the person for the appointment is the result of\na process that:\n\n(i) was merit-based; and\n\n(ii) included public advertising of the position.\n\n(3) Paragraph (2)(b) does not apply in relation to the reappointment of\na person who, immediately before the start of the period of\nreappointment, holds office as the National Children’s\nCommissioner under a previous appointment under subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) A person must not be appointed under subsection (1) as the\nNational Children’s Commissioner unless the Minister is satisfied\nthat:\n\n(a) the person has appropriate qualifications, knowledge or\nexperience; and\n\n(b) the selection of the person for the appointment is the result of\na process that:\n\n(i) was merit-based; and\n\n(ii) included public advertising of the position.\n\n(3) Paragraph (2)(b) does not apply in relation to the reappointment of\na person who, immediately before the start of the period of\nreappointment, holds office as the National Children’s\nCommissioner under a previous appointment under subsection (1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-13-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-13-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022a00048#sch-1-sec-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Subsection 46MC(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) A person must not be appointed under subsection (1) as the\nNational Children’s Commissioner unless the Minister is satisfied\nthat:\n\n(a) the person has appropriate qualifications, knowledge or\nexperience; and\n\n(b) the selection of the person for the appointment is the result of\na process that:\n\n(i) was merit-based; and\n\n(ii) included public advertising of the position.\n\n(3) Paragraph (2)(b) does not apply in relation to the reappointment of\na person who, immediately before the start of the period of\nreappointment, holds office as the National Children’s\nCommissioner under a previous appointment under subsection (1)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-13-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13(2) Subsection 46MC(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2022a00048#sch-1-sec-13-ss-2"
